<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down at 2.8895 vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down at 2.8895 vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8895 to the dollar, down from 2.8790 on Tuesday and at 1.8385 to the mark, up from 1.8430, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
